 study will help us to better understand the perspective of the conquered population in the face of these new developments through the Syriac accounts which have a somewhat different point of view from the Arab-Islamic historical sources.</note></biblStruct><bibl type="formatted" subtype="bibliography" resp="https://www.zotero.org/styles/chicago-note-bibliography-17th-edition">
